{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm to Table</strong> is a farming and restaurant management sim with a pinch of build-anywhere freedom where you build a restaurant with a backyard farm. Grow your organic business into a 5-star restaurant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a colorful island where you can grow food, gather wild flavors, raise animals for fresh produce, go fishing, make better food with machines and cook delicious recipes for your hungry guests. Build and decorate your dream place wherever and however you want!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/20612ba752cfa3d6c56d26d4de2e1d36.poster.avif?t=1763111442\" width=610 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/20612ba752cfa3d6c56d26d4de2e1d36.webm?t=1763111442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/20612ba752cfa3d6c56d26d4de2e1d36.mp4?t=1763111442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Anywhere in Any Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design the corners of your tiny cottage garden into a fine dining restaurant, turn it into your dream organic place and grow your farmstead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/8fff0448b33920c97ea91ec9d5f42763.poster.avif?t=1763111442\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/8fff0448b33920c97ea91ec9d5f42763.webm?t=1763111442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/8fff0448b33920c97ea91ec9d5f42763.mp4?t=1763111442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow, Raise &amp; Harvest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow food, plant trees, and raise animals right by your kitchen, gather fresh produce and adopt pet companions. One harvest at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/ac321f45762fdd03b409507643b354c1.poster.avif?t=1763111442\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/ac321f45762fdd03b409507643b354c1.webm?t=1763111442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/ac321f45762fdd03b409507643b354c1.mp4?t=1763111442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook &amp; Serve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create diverse menus, explore recipes to cook &amp; bake harvest into delicious meals that build your reputation and attract even more guests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/ff3903f6524e561ba228d7cac402f294.poster.avif?t=1763111442\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/ff3903f6524e561ba228d7cac402f294.webm?t=1763111442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/ff3903f6524e561ba228d7cac402f294.mp4?t=1763111442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather &amp; Fish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore special flavors like wild mushrooms, berries and much more in the wild or go fishing in the open seas for rare catches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/bc5e9dec81c96a52d2837ca6087bd229.poster.avif?t=1763111442\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/bc5e9dec81c96a52d2837ca6087bd229.webm?t=1763111442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/bc5e9dec81c96a52d2837ca6087bd229.mp4?t=1763111442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources, improve recipes, upgrade your farmstead, hire staff to keep the restaurant running and get useful machines to turn ingredients into better food products. Grow your organic business exploring a vast world full of delicious ingredients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/31a91ccda7f0324e4fb29bcf4f9c99c4.poster.avif?t=1763111442\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/31a91ccda7f0324e4fb29bcf4f9c99c4.webm?t=1763111442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/extras/31a91ccda7f0324e4fb29bcf4f9c99c4.mp4?t=1763111442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3582250?t=1763111442","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582250/fc5840be94e1e66af30cbeaad8be1cbcfb397789/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763111442",